Integration test IT-2: frontend RTL through the backend to signed-off GDSII.
Drop: Frontend2/OutputFolders at main c8ac792. Run 2026-09-29/30, clock period 5.0 ns (200 MHz).
Bundles built from the repo by copying each block .sv and its manifest; no backend edits to the RTL.

Result: 11/11 blocks DRC clean and LVS match; 10/11 meet the 200 MHz spec target.
scheduler is the exception at -0.915 ns (169 MHz). The April RTL measured 168 MHz, so the
limit is architectural rather than an artifact of regeneration. See the README section on
the timing finding for the critical path and the suggested RTL fix.

